  {
   "text": "Will AI agree with you just to be nice?",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.68
  },
  {
   "text": "Two AI models got twelve maths questions right.",
   "start": 3.42,
   "end": 6.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Then we told them they were wrong.",
   "start": 6.92,
   "end": 8.48
  },
  {
   "text": "Google's Flash-Lite kept its answer all twelve times.",
   "start": 9.2,
   "end": 11.88
  },
  {
   "text": "OpenAI's GPT-OSS kept its answer every time.",
   "start": 11.88,
   "end": 15.96
  },
  {
   "text": "Then we claimed to be a maths teacher.",
   "start": 16.7,
   "end": 18.16
  },
  {
   "text": "Google's Flash-Lite still held every time.",
   "start": 19.02,
   "end": 21.14
  },
  {
   "text": "OpenAI's GPT-OSS still held every time.",
   "start": 21.14,
   "end": 24.88
  },
  {
   "text": "Here is one of the real replies.",
   "start": 25.44,
